{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":2837716,"ns":0,"title":"Fretting","extract":"Fretting is wear and sometimes corrosion damage of loaded surfaces in contact while they encounter small oscillatory movements tangential to the surface. Fretting is caused by adhesion of contact surface asperities, which are subsequently broken again by the small movement.","description":"Wear or damage on loaded surfaces","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}